About**
This Thread contains my Custom Kernel Builds for OPlus Devices.. These are Mainly intended for Testing, Development, and Performance..

KernelSU Forks Included:
Official KernelSU [KSU](https://github.com/tiann/KernelSU)
KernelSU Next [KSUN](https://github.com/KernelSU-Next/KernelSU-Next)
SukiSU Ultra [SukiSU](https://github.com/SukiSU-Ultra/SukiSU-Ultra)
ReSukiSU [ReSukiSU](https://github.com/ReSukiSU/ReSukiSU)
WildKSU [WKSU](https://github.com/WildKernels/Wild_KSU)

**Source**
Based on the OPlus Kernel Tree [OnePlusOSS](
Compiled with Clang Toolchain
Custom Patches Applied
Note: Not all Builds are Guaranteed to be Stable.. Tested on Snapdragon 8 Elite / Oryon Platforms..

**Features**
SUSFS4OKI [OKI](https://github.com/cctv18/susfs4oki) / SUSFS4KSU / SUSFS Module [Module](https://github.com/sidex15/susfs4ksu-module)
Baseband Guard BBG
KPM Support
ZRAM (LZ4 + ZSTD)
IPSET
BBR + ECN
HMBIRD
Unicode Bypass
XUS Fix
ADIOS I/O Scheduler
More Features will be Added soon..

**Installation**
**Requirements**
Stock boot & init_boot images from your ROM
[Download ROM](https://roms.danielspringer.at/)
KernelFlasher (Recommended) [KernelFlasher](https://github.com/fatalcoder524/KernelFlasher)
Steps
Flash Stock "boot.img" and "init_boot.img"
Flash AnyKernel3 ZIP
Reboot
Custom Recovery Installation: Supported

Back to Stock?
Flash Stock "boot.img"
